<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - New York City Development Agency.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - New York City Development Agency.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK CITY INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $107,500,000</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(1991 JAPAN AIRLINES COMPANY, LTD. PROJECT)</p>
<p>Effective at 10:30 A.M. E.S.T., Monday, November 4, 1996 all syndicate terms and price restrictions were removed and the bonds are be free to trade.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
